<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>400 Bad Request</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Error response</h1>
  <p><strong>Error code:</strong> 400</p>
  <p><strong>Message:</strong> Body must be JSON.</p>
  <p><strong>Error code explanation:</strong> 400 - Bad Request / invalid user input.</p>
</body>
</html>

